    old "Eh?{#ch21_s_151}"
    new "А?"

    old "I keep thinking there must have been another way…{#ch21_si_074}"
    new "Я всё думаю, должен был быть другой выход…"

    old "And when I think about it, I feel so very heavy-hearted.{#ch21_si_075}"
